  "sbBodyHowCalc": "Six balas are added: Sthana (positional), Dig (directional), Kala (temporal), Chesta (motional), Naisargika (natural) and Drik (aspectual). The total is compared with the planet's required minimum to get a percentage.",
  "sbBodyHowUse": "A planet above 100% comfortably delivers its significations; below 100% it needs support. Favour your strongest planets for important matters, and give the weakest ones remedies and patience.",
